    "title": "Alabama Crimson Tide drops NCAA Tournament opener with former Hagerty standout Ana Roman",
    "text": "The Alabama Crimson Tide, featuring former Hagerty High School standout Ana Roman, was narrowly defeated 5-4 by the Texas Tech Lady Raiders in NCAA Tournament action on Monday, June 1.\nThe matchup was held at Devon Park with a 6 p.m. start.\nAlabama Crimson Tide is scheduled for its next game on Monday, June 1, at 9 p.m., also at Devon Park.\nAna Roman — Outfielder — Freshman — 5′8″ — Hometown: Oviedo",
